[character name="women"]
【女性店员】[r]「欢迎光临～」
[np]

[r]还是一如既往，这家店的冷气开得很足，简直像天堂一样。
[np]

[mion storage="B_seifuku_M AB1_2_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00460_005.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_AB1_2_FACE_seifuku"]
