[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「那我要冰奶茶吧」
[np]

[mion storage="D_seifuku_M CD1_3_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00460_006.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_3_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「嗯……我就喝冰咖啡好了」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

;//★＠
[playcv storage="shop_mion_00460_002.ogg" name="women"]
[character name="women"]
【女性店员】[r]「好的。冰奶茶和冰咖啡对吧」
[np]

[r]听完点单的店员低头行了一礼，面带微笑转身离去。
[np]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「说起来，今天来车站前是有事要办对吧？」
[np]

[mion storage="C_seifuku_M CD1_2_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00460_007.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_2_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「算是吧，不过准确来说是来购物。今天可是打算让龙一你好好帮忙呢」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「购物…帮忙？」
[np]

[mion storage="B_seifuku_M AB1_3_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00460_008.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_AB1_3_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「简单来说就是帮忙拿东西啦」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「啊、原来如此……搬行李的话我可是很拿手的！」
[np]

[mion storage="A_seifuku_M AB1_2_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00460_009.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_AB1_2_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「呵呵，很可靠呢」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]毕竟，之前可是被狠狠使唤了一番……应该不至于像那次那么惨了吧！
